<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philimon</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIMONA veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philimon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phil</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIMONA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">Philimon cun nglongthangki Khritjan, Kolawte sangcim üng ve lü Onesimas tinaki mpya mat takia kyaki. Ahina mpya cun a mah üngkhyüh dawng lü thawng k'uma veki Pawluh am ngkhyumki ni. Pawluh üngkhyüh Onesimas cun Khritjana thawn lawki ni. <char style="bk">Philimona vei Pawluha cayuk</char> hin Pawluh naw a tüih bea a mpya cun mhlätei lü mpyaa kba a doei be däka am kya lü Khritjan benaa kba do lü Philimon ja a mpya ami ng’yenak vaia ni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Philimon mhlünmtainak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimas phäh nghuinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Akpäihnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Khritaw Jesuha phäh thawng üng kyumki Pawluh ja mi bena Timoti üngkhyüh —</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Kami nglawipüi ja khut kami bi püi Philimon ja <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4:17</ref></char></note>na ima ngkhämkia sangcim ja mi ci Apphia ja ngtuk mi pawh püi Akhipaha veia ni:<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Mi Pa Pamhnam ja Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw naw bäkhäknak ja dimdeihnak ning pe se.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philimona mhläkphyanak ja jumeinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Ka na Philimon naw ka ktaiyüa kcün naküt üng nang ning süm lü Pamhnam veia jenak ka mthehki. <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>Pamhnama khyange na jah mhläkphyanak ja Bawi Jesuh üng na taka jumnak ka ngjaka phäh ni. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Ka ktaiyünak ta mi ngkhawteinak üng jumeikia mi kya akba, Khritaw am mi yümmatnak üng vekia dawkyanak naküt cun akdaw mi ksingnak däm däm vaia kyaki. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Ka na aw, na mhläkphyanak naw na jekyaisak lü ngjuktha na pe ve! Nang naw Pamhnama khyangea mlung jah suhne veki.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Onesimasa phäh nghuinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Ahina phäha Khritaw üng ka ning na akba kei naw yet lü i pawh vai ti hin ngthu ning mtheh veng. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Isetiakyaküng ning kphya na lü ka ning nghuinak ni. Khritaw Jesuha ngsä, ania phäha tuha kcün üng thawng kyum kei Pawluh naw ka pawh ni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw Jesuha ngsä,ania phäh tuha kcün üng thawng kyum; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">am ani üng </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khritaw Jesuha phäh atuha thawng kyum a xüngvai.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 :</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4:9</ref></char></note> Khritaw üng ka ca, thawng üng ka kyum k'um üng ngmüimkhya lama a na pa naw Onesimasa kcaha ning nghui na veng. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Ahlana ani cun ia am ngtäh lüpi atuha nang ja keia phäh ani cun summang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Krik ngming Onesimas ti cun “summang vai” tia kyaki.</char></note> vai kya ve.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Ani am ka mlung ngpüi law lü na veia ka tüih law be ni. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Thangkdawa phäh thawng üng ka kyum üng nanga kcaha na kuei khaia ka hlawnga a ve vai ka täng kyaw. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Acunsepi, na na kuei vaia käh ka ning sihling na khai, acuna kthaka na titänga na bilawh vai ni ka täng ve. Nang naw am ä xaki lü i pi am pawh veng.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Onesimas cun nang üngkhyüh asäng thuk lü a ve hin na hlawnga akcün tä a ve vaia phäh ni. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Atuha mpya sawxata am kya lü mpyaa kthak dawki Khritaw üng na mhlänaka na naa kyaki ni. Ani cun keia phäh aktäa daw ve! Nanga phäh pi aktäa daw khai ni. Ani cun mpya ja Bawipa üng na na akba salü daw bawk khai ni!<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Acunakyase, na na püia na ngaih üngta, kei na na dokhama mäiha ani pi dokham bea. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Ani naw a ning thung vai am ani üng a ning mkhyenak üngpi ka ning thung vai ta kawm pi. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Kei Pawluh naw ka ning thungkhih khai ti lü ka kut ye am ka yuk law ni: (na sak phäh na je na bä ka ning mtheh vai am hlü khai ni.) <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Acunakyase, ka na aw, Khritaw üng na bea kba na jesak lü Bawipa phäha ka hmai bük lü ahin hin keia khana pawha.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Ahin ka yuk lawa kba na pawh khaia ka ksingki, ahina kthaka pi na pawh khai tia ka ksingki ni. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Acuna thea, keia phäh akhan na tak pet bä, isetiakyaküng, Pamhnam naw nami vana ktaiyünak ning jah msak lü na veia ka lawnak vai na pe khai tia ka äpeiki ni.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnaka hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref></char>
    </note>Jesuh Khritawa phäh thawng üng ka kyum püi Epapharah naw ning jah hnukset ve, <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: a</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Ngs 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Ngs 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Tim 4:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Tim 4:11</ref></char></note> khut ka bipüie Makuh, Aristakhas, Demah ja Luhka naw pi ning hnukset ve u.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa bäkhäknak nami vana khana ve se.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
